@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox
title US015 - To put for a sale a publication in my library in a direct sale

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : I want to put for sale a publication in a direct sale
activate System
System --> User : Which publication(s)? Choose from the list!
deactivate System
User -> System : Selected publication(s)
activate System
System --> User : Specify title, price, short description and pictures for the listing
deactivate System
User -> System : Title, price, short description, pictures
activate System
System --> User : Publication(s) put for direct sale with success
deactivate System

@enduml